        "rationale": "Both new tests patch os.killpg and os.kill, assert killpg(4321, SIGTERM) is called exactly once, and parametrize the refusal over 9 unsafe values, asserting no signal is sent; the agent also showed the tests fail with the guard removed, but they ran only under a stand-in for pytest, not real pytest."
      },
